<title>USA: Omaha cattle $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers active, $0.50 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to Choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 63.00-64.50, few mainly Choice 65.00. Select 61.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 63.00-64.50, three loads largely Choice 65.00.</p>
